,title,link,text,language,family
0,Shima-uta - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shima-uta,"Shima-uta (シマウタ, しまうた, 島歌, 島唄, Amami:Simaota,[1] Yoron:Simauta[2]) is a genre of songs originating from the Amami Islands, northern Ryukyu Islands in the southwest of Japan. It became known nationwide in the 2000s with the success of young pop singers from Amami Ōshima such as Hajime Chitose and Atari Kōsuke.","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
1,Amami Ōshima language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amami_Ōshima_language,"The Amami language or languages, also known as Amami Ōshima or simply Ōshima, is a Ryukyuan language spoken in the Amami Islands south of Kyūshū.","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
2,"A Study of Amami Folk Songs: 'Hounen-bushi', 'Uke-Kuma Manjo ...",https://note.com/furimun/n/n24c78c02fb68?hl=en,"Furthermore, due to the influence of the 'Amami Oshima Southern Folk Song Boom' in the world of Amami folk music until a decade ago, and the 'Amami Oshima Northern Folk Song Boom' that continued for a while after the war, 'Amami Oshima Southern Folk Songs' are currently dominant in terms of influence.","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
3,PERFORMING ARTS - Amami Travel,https://amamitravel.com/performing-arts/,"Amami Oshima has a rich and distinctive performing arts culture, deeply rooted in traditional dance and folk music. One of the island’s most significant traditional performances is Hachigatsu Odori (August Dance), which is held in villages across Amami Oshima.","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
4,Amami Oshima shimauta - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=12Badsl_hbM,"Apr 27, 2011 · www.amamijapan.com Short clip of traditional shimauta music from Amami Oshima, English national living in Amami Oshima, who can help in accommodation or any information that you may...","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
5,AMAMI: Shimauta ― Amami's Soul Music - Time-lapse Japan | NHK ...,https://www3.nhk.or.jp/nhkworld/en/shows/6053003/,"Jul 23, 2023 · Shimauta is the soul music of Amami Oshima. Islanders have long used it to convey feelings in good times and bad. The history of the music and of the island itself is conveyed in time-lapse...","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
6,Shima Uta (Amami) - Myclopedia - Index - Mi (my)crotonal piano,https://mymicrotonalpiano.com/Facts/Myclopedia/ShimautaAmami.html,"Amami folk songs, commonly known as 'Shima-uta,' are unique traditional songs that have been passed down in the Amami Islands, particularly on Amami Oshima, Kikaijima, Kakeromajima, and Tokunoshima.","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
7,【4K Amami Oshima(World heritage) Nature Sounds with Amami ...,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MuhpRtNsdgc,"Jul 26, 2021 · This special album, featuring ""Amami Citaion Award"" winner Shingo Maeyama, features shamisen (three-stringed Japanese banjo) and songs as well as natural sounds recorded on site.","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
8,Guide to the Breathtaking Amami Oshima: Nature... | Rakuten Travel,https://travel.rakuten.com/contents/usa/en-us/guide/amami-oshima-guide/,"Explore Amami Oshima, from lush forests to vibrant coral reefs. Book today and experience a stay at Japan’s hidden island paradise.Music is central to Amami Oshima's cultural expression, with the unique sanshin instrument at the focus.","Amami-Oshima, Northern",Japonic
